 "about": "Tolerance bands of the IA power spectra for Roman cosmic shear: the fractional perturbation eps of P_X(k, z) -> P_X [1 + sum_j eps_j h_j(k)] (h_j tent functions in ln k at the nodes, the same at every z; X = GI, II, or both with the same eps) below which the shift of the best-fit (Omega_m, S8) stays below FoB = 0.3. Truth: FLAMINGO D3A cosmology, GG + the stitched FLAMINGO IA (NLA below k_t(z), spline of the measured spectra above) injected through sim_IA; covariance example1_cov; model refitted with all parameters free. single: tolerance of node j alone; joint: a box in which every combination of signs and sizes stays below 0.3 (each node the same share of the budget, capped at 1). Linear response at the best fit (analysis/roman_dchi2/v7/tolerance_bands.py -> v7/tolerance_bands.json). nodes in h/Mpc. This figure: the bands for the production masks k_UV = K0/D(z), K0 = 0.2 to 0.5, case A.",
